  (text "To do: " (at 344.17 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ae0d4571-a240-4ee3-9863-eb52fdc7a812)
  )
  (text "Note: VCC here is 3.7V aka VBAT!" (at 93.345 45.085 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c171298b-1ca2-49be-93d7-0847bdb585ad)
  )
  (text "There are pins that are risky to use (aka hard to replicate on nrf52840_dk) :\nhttps://devzone.nordicsemi.com/f/nordic-q-a/53445/nrf52840-gpio-simple-input-read-issue\n\nThese include: \nP0.00,  P0.01   -> used by LFCLK and need to be physically disconnected on dk\nP0.05 - P0.08  -> used by interface MCU (the on board debugger)\nP0.09,  P0.10   -> used by NFC\nP0.11 - P0.16  -> used by the buttons and leds on dk\nP0.24 - P0.25  -> used by the buttons and leds on dk\nP0.17           -> used by QSPI external memories\nP0.19 - P0.23  -> used by QSPI external memories\n\nNote that we can use SWD's RTT to console print instead of UART"
    (at 219.202 46.736 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c4c94e5e-22fa-4c03-90c5-9e8147cc482c)
  )
  (text "Notes:\n\nUsing reference circuit config 6 from : https://infocenter.nordicsemi.com/index.jsp?topic=%2Fps_nrf52840%2Fref_circuitry.html\nExternal 32kHz crystal is used for more accurate LFCLK (which is used by RTC and watchdog). I don't think I need it.\nVdd max rating is 3.6V. I'm using a 1s 3.7V LiPo, so AP2112K is to bring MCP7381 down to 3.3V  \nI'm not using the radio, so I'm grounding ANT following this recommendation:\nhttps://devzone.nordicsemi.com/f/nordic-q-a/102288/should-the-antenna-ant-pin-be-left-floating-or-tied-to-gnd-if-not-in-use"
    (at 17.78 29.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d0cb1526-38c8-4060-9df4-9d2684965c8e)
  )
  (text "Note: Use X7R or X5R for the 1uF caps!" (at 145.415 36.195 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f24c1b80-5f94-4e85-9ac4-d9a3e2c4f99a)
  )

